 "intro": "How to report an order, a request or a piece of advice that someone gave in the past.",
 "palabras": [
  {
   "palabra": "me pidió que",
   "significado": "he/she asked me to",
   "pron": "me pi-DYO ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "After «pedir que» the verb goes in the subjunctive: «me pidió que llamara».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "me aconsejó que",
   "significado": "he/she advised me to",
   "pron": "me a-kon-se-HO ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "«Aconsejar que» asks for the subjunctive. If the advice was in the past: «me aconsejó que esperara».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "me ordenó que",
   "significado": "he/she ordered me to",
   "pron": "me or-de-NO ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "The original order changes: «entregue» becomes «entregara» when you report it later.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "me rogó que",
   "significado": "he/she begged me to",
   "pron": "me rro-GO ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "«Rogar» is to ask very strongly. In the present it is «ruego»; in the past, «rogó».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "me recomendó que",
   "significado": "he/she recommended that I",
   "pron": "me rre-ko-men-DO ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "«Recomendar» changes e to ie in the present: «recomiendo». In the past it is «recomendó».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "me prohibió que",
   "significado": "he/she forbade me to",
   "pron": "me pro-i-BYO ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "The h is silent and the accent on «ió» marks the stress: pro-i-BYO. It asks for the subjunctive.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "insistió en que",
   "significado": "he/she insisted that",
   "pron": "in-sis-TYO en ke",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "You say «insistir en», never «insistir que». The subjunctive follows.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "al día siguiente",
   "significado": "the next day",
   "pron": "al DI-a si-GYEN-te",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "In reported speech it replaces «mañana»: «dijo: mañana» becomes «dijo que al día siguiente».",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
   "palabra": "aquel día",
   "significado": "that day",
   "pron": "a-KEL DI-a",
   "ipa": "",
   "cat": "set expression",
   "genero": "",
   "plural": "",
   "definida": "",
   "consejo": "In reported speech it replaces «hoy» when you tell of something that happened earlier.",
   "nota": "",
   "oculta": false
  },
  {
